<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Light Leathers yr profit NZ$1.03 mln.</title>
<headline>NZ Light Leathers yr profit NZ$1.03 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 1.03 vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   17.1 vs 0.2</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    5.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				25.4 vs 24.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  1.7 vs 0.04</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Note - New Zealand Light Leathers Ltd is a leather processor.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
